# cybsh: 1
# lib.cybsh — shared `def`s for `import "/scripts/lib.cybsh" [as ns]`.
# Only `def`s travel; caps and frontmatter stay with the importing file.
# Run it directly too (`run /scripts/lib.cybsh`) — it just defines.
# See also: tour.cybsh (imports this file), functions.cybsh.

def greet(name):
  return "hi " + name + "!"

def shout(s):
  return s + "!"

def first(items, fallback):
  if len(items) == 0:
    return fallback
  return items[0]
